    "blurb": "Arabic-ready inbound messaging for Camunda",
    "overview": "A GCC-focused inbound connector that brings WhatsApp, Telegram, and SMS messages into Camunda 8 workflows with Arabic normalization, message routing, and real-time process triggering.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Real-Time Messaging Integration for GCC Workflows",
    "splashDescription": "The Inbound Messaging Connector for Camunda 8 enables workflows to react to real-time customer messages from WhatsApp, Telegram, and GCC SMS providers. It provides a unified inbound pipeline with Arabic text normalization, message routing, attachment handling, and seamless process instantiation or message correlation. Built for organizations in the GCC region, it ensures reliable workflow automation for chat-driven service requests, claims, support tasks, and conversational processes.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/677340/overview/img9212832528255304188.png?4a7b4904e9d5edd8d308551ad58ee50d",
